  <content>
    <procedure>
      <preliminaryRqmts>Review the general description of the Auxiliary Power Unit before starting this procedure. See <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="MERM100" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="049" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00AA" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="022" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef> for the system overview.</preliminaryRqmts>
      <mainProcedure>
        <proceduralStep>
          <para>Open the auxiliary power unit access panel. Refer to <graphicRef infoEntityIdent="ICN-MERM10012A00-001"/> for panel fastener locations.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <para>Disconnect the inlet duct clamp and remove the inlet filter element.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <para>Inspect the filter element for contamination and discard if damaged.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
      </mainProcedure>
      <closeRqmts>Close and secure the auxiliary power unit access panel.</closeRqmts>
    </procedure>
